{"unit_id":"vibeinging__dsh-tool-search#card-zh","repo":"vibeinging/dsh-tool-search","commit":"265ce76eda21b211dc4a4c8f30d73a6826f035ca","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-search 是一款面向 DSH Native Tool Mode 的工具发现插件，为每个 agent 提供独立的 tool_search。它按工具名称与描述进行词法排序，优先匹配精确名称，并用 BM25 返回有限数量的候选工具；被选中的工具会在后续请求中加载。插件将选择快照写入会话，以便恢复或分叉后继续使用，并保留 alwaysVisible 配置的全局工具。适合工具较多、希望按需发现和加载工具的 DSH 使用场景；无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:126-187","src/index.ts:305-359","src/index.ts:361-442"]}
{"unit_id":"vibeinging__dsh-tool-search#card-en","repo":"vibeinging/dsh-tool-search","commit":"265ce76eda21b211dc4a4c8f30d73a6826f035ca","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-search adds per-agent tool discovery to DSH Native Tool Mode. Agents search global tool names and descriptions with exact-name priority and BM25, then load selected tools for later requests. Session snapshots restore selections after resume or fork. It needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:126-187","src/index.ts:305-359","src/index.ts:361-442"]}
